00:18:29.420 --> 00:18:29.859
Hindi.

00:18:30.619 --> 00:18:31.180
Hindi.

00:18:31.420 --> 00:18:31.779
Punong Patnugot.

00:18:31.940 --> 00:18:32.779
Mabuti. Ituloy natin.

00:18:38.859 --> 00:18:41.220
Tiyak na maituturing itong overtime.

00:18:41.259 --> 00:18:42.660
At kaninong kasalanan iyon?

00:18:42.980 --> 00:18:43.980
Iniwan mo ang meeting.

00:18:44.019 --> 00:18:45.460
Kung hindi, wala tayo rito.

00:18:46.220 --> 00:18:46.859
Ikaw ang pinakamagaling.

00:18:46.900 --> 00:18:47.900
Ikaw lang ang sasama sa akin noon.

00:18:48.619 --> 00:18:49.619
Bibilhan mo ako ng meryenda para sa gabi mamaya.

00:18:49.700 --> 00:18:50.059
Sigurado.

00:18:53.619 --> 00:18:54.019
Anong problema?

00:18:55.700 --> 00:18:56.099
Tara na.

00:18:58.579 --> 00:18:59.019
Wala lang 'yon.

00:18:59.500 --> 00:19:00.019
Tara na pumasok na tayo.

00:19:00.099 --> 00:19:00.460
Akala ko...

00:19:00.460 --> 00:19:01.819
Ayaw mo akong bilhan ng meryenda na 'yan.

00:19:01.940 --> 00:19:03.099
Ano ba ang pinagsasabi mo?

00:19:06.660 --> 00:19:07.500
Nasa ikalawang palapag ang book signing.

00:19:09.900 --> 00:19:10.420
May oras pa tayo kahit kaunti.

00:19:10.420 --> 00:19:11.180
Umakyat ka muna.

00:19:11.180 --> 00:19:11.700
Gusto kong tumingin-tingin sa paligid.

00:19:11.980 --> 00:19:12.900
Sige, pero bilisan mo.

00:20:01.579 --> 00:20:02.180
Ayos lang.

00:20:02.579 --> 00:20:03.420
Ikaw... kaya mo... ayos lang.

00:20:05.180 --> 00:20:05.660
Heto na.

00:20:08.019 --> 00:20:08.500
Salamat.

